OL,3,GNEWSAPlea after pregnant hedgehog
OL,4,A'kicked to death'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: distressing content
OL,8,FA pregnant hedgehog died after being
OL,9,F"kicked around like a football" in West
OL,10,FYorkshire, prompting an appeal from an
OL,11,Fanimal rescue charity.
OL,13,FCastleford Hedgehog Rescue said it had
OL,14,Ftaken the hedgehog in on Friday night
OL,15,Fafter the charity was told it had been
OL,16,Fattacked by a group of boys in nearby
OL,17,FSharlston Common.
