OL,4,A'kicked to death'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeth Campsill, from the charity, said
OL,7,Fthe "heartbreaking" situation was one
OL,8,Fof the worst cases of animal cruelty
OL,9,Fshe had seen in 16 years of running the
OL,10,Fcentre.
